Bash, foreground:

```bash
git -C $R worktree add $R/.claude/worktrees/wg-keepalive-docs -b chore/wg-keepalive-docs-close origin/main
```

Agent tool (model sonnet, background), prompt:

> Reply in English. Work only in `<abs path>/wg-keepalive-docs`. Your only source is `$S/evidence/wg-keepalive/`: the deploy log, the re-run log (changed=0), the read-only verification, the operator's ping summary, and the #165 merge SHA. Bring `projects/ccs/soul/<ccs-it hosts>.md` to the verified state. Update the living docs the change affects. Mark the design doc and plan "implemented — PR #165, `<sha>`". Docs only. No session links. Commit locally, do not push. Report the files, the head SHA, the evidence line behind each claim, and anything the evidence does not support.

## 7. Operator

AskUserQuestion:

